tip: | Look at the heart. | One color and one outline. It reads at any size because the shape does all the work.
tip: 1 | Start with the silhouette. | Fill the shape in one color. Each edge steps one pixel at a time with no stray corners, and the two lobes match.
tip: 5 | Try the outline. | With the Eraser, take one pixel out of the notch at the top. Then press Outline layer under Shadow and outline. The 1 px line follows the new shape. | eraser
